  "description": "You like the look of the standard Big Wig but you think your riding is progressing down a more extreme path? The Race spec features a longer 150mm Lyrik RC to make this edition of the Big Wig our rowdiest yet.\nOther upgrades over the standard bike includes an SLX/XT 12-speed groupset and Nukeproof’s Horizon V2 wheelset, now used by their multiple EWS winning race team. The rest of the spec is the usual blend of performance and reliability to fit the no-nonsense Ragley ethos.\nThe Big Wig frameset features ISCG 05 tabs, a 44mm head tube, internal dropper routing and a 148x12mm boost rear end. Our steel frames are engineered from custom triple butted 4130 Chromoly tubing for a frame that is stiff but lively and comfortable for those all-day epics.\nEnjoy leaving your full suspension riding friends behind? Look ahead, hold on and get wild...",
